              "inline_data": null,
              "text": "I would love to help you find parking, but as an AI, I cannot directly book reservations or process payments on your behalf. \n\nTo help me point you to the right platform or provide the best parking zones, **could you let me know which city you are planning to visit?** \n\nDepending on your location, you can easily reserve a spot or set up payment using the following options:\n\n### 1. If you are in Romania (e.g., Bucharest, Cluj-Napoca, Timi\u0219oara, etc.):\n* **For Street Parking:** \n  * **AmParcat:** One of the most popular and user-friendly apps in Romania for paying and managing street parking (including district-managed spots in Bucharest).\n  * **TPARK:** A highly reliable app operating in over 50 Romanian cities that lets you pay easily via card or SMS.\n  * **Parking Bucure\u0219ti:** The official app for municipal parking lots (marked with blue lines) if you are in the capital.\n* **For Underground/Private Garages (City Center):** \n  * **Interparking (P-app):** If you are parking in major central underground garages (like University Square or Intercontinental in Bucharest), downloading the **P-app** allows for ticketless, automatic entry/exit and often comes with discounted hourly rates.\n\n### 2. If you are in North America or Western Europe:\n* **SpotHero** or **ParkWhiz:** Excellent for finding and pre-booking spaces in parking garages at discounted rates in major U.S. and Canadian cities.\n* **Parkopedia:** Great for comparing real-time parking prices and availability across the UK, Europe, and globally.\n\n**Please reply with the city and, if possible, the specific area or landmark you'll be visiting.** Once you share that, I can suggest the closest parking garages, tell you how the zone pricing works, and guide you to the exact booking link!",
